{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-27T02:40:42.304Z","id":"01M10HEMA0WSATN7B6Q5TWB0M4","order":"xqzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Key Guardrails: Curated '.' barrels with no 'export *' wildcards, no 'tsconfig paths' aliases (preserves compile-time exports gating via Node16/NodeNext), and warn-only complexity limits.","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T02:40:42.304Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-27T02:40:45.475Z","id":"01M10HEQD3YWE61WX1SFNB1CNC","order":"yvhzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Enforcement: Compile-time gating via tsc (error TS2307 on unexported subpaths) + Runtime rejection via Node/Bun (ERR_PACKAGE_PATH_NOT_EXPORTED).","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T02:40:45.475Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-27T03:26:02.870Z","id":"01M10M1N3PX14P6TNZF60JZFKK","order":"hzzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"code example attention markers: Use explicit comment markers (// ✅ ATTENTION:, // ⚠️ CRITICAL:, // ❌ FORBIDDEN:, // 🔒 COMPILE-TIME:) in examples to highlight key design decisions, safety rules, and anti-patterns.","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T03:26:02.870Z"}
{"children":["01M19NJSFFQC3TK7WFDJD2Q3JN","01M19NJSM9PR33Q5TG12X6RQZ1","01M19NJSRSZS0MBERKWRP0PENB","01M19NJSX293TQ0D2E9M8P7TJ4","01M19NJT1QRD839WZ8F08PX8EH"],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T15:45:55.667Z","id":"01M19NJJEKQ6W702HK4413FRHJ","order":"y777777776","props":{},"text":"ts-features: TypeScript type system features, compiler mechanics, and production patterns.","updatedAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.447Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:02.863Z","id":"01M19NJSFFQC3TK7WFDJD2Q3JN","order":"hzzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Location: ts-features/ (TypeScript implementation with Bun runtime, typecheck, and test suite).","updatedAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:02.863Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.016Z","id":"01M19NJSM9PR33Q5TG12X6RQZ1","order":"qzzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Casting & Assertions: Mechanics of 'as T' (Sufficient Overlap Rule, TS2352) vs. zero runtime type conversion (Type Erasure).","updatedAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.016Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.161Z","id":"01M19NJSRSZS0MBERKWRP0PENB","order":"vhzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Chain Casting Hazards: Why 'as unknown as T' silences compiler errors, producing runtime type illusions, missing method crashes, deserialization bugs, and refactoring drift.","updatedAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.161Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.298Z","id":"01M19NJSX293TQ0D2E9M8P7TJ4","order":"xqzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Safe Alternatives: User-defined type predicates ('is'), schema parsing ('Parse, don't validate'), domain mappers, discriminated unions, and 'satisfies'.","updatedAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.298Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.447Z","id":"01M19NJT1QRD839WZ8F08PX8EH","order":"yvhzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Run simulation via 'bun run demo:casting' or 'bun test' inside ts-features/.","updatedAt":"2026-08-30T15:46:03.447Z"}
