{"children":["01M1DRN9PMZGSS1D0Z634PK713","01M1DRNA0FAH3WKNSTQ2RD6HH0","01M1DRNAB8Y6P4E1RXEF70TXFA","01M1DRNBWJHNMMC3SKDC01BC9X"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:44.739Z","id":"01M1DRN62308T1G0K8Y8ARJTRN","order":"zjsssssssr","props":{},"text":"monorepo-tooling-pnpm-nx-vp: Architectural mechanics, anti-patterns, and unification of pnpm, Nx, and vp (Vite-Plus).","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:50.706Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:48.466Z","id":"01M1DRN9PMZGSS1D0Z634PK713","order":"hzzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Location: monorepo-tooling-pnpm-nx-vp/ (TypeScript implementation with Bun runtime and test suite).","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:48.466Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:48.782Z","id":"01M1DRNA0FAH3WKNSTQ2RD6HH0","order":"qzzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"The Golden Monorepo Triangle: pnpm as Dependency Manager (catalogs, strict symlinks), Nx as Task Orchestrator & Computation Cache (DAG scheduling, affected, module boundaries), and vp (Vite-Plus) as Inner-Loop Developer Toolchain (Oxfmt, Oxlint complexity sensors, Vite/Rolldown, Vitest).","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:48.782Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:49.128Z","id":"01M1DRNAB8Y6P4E1RXEF70TXFA","order":"vhzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Run interactive master tour via 'bun run demo' or 'bun test' inside monorepo-tooling-pnpm-nx-vp/.","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:49.128Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:50.706Z","id":"01M1DRNBWJHNMMC3SKDC01BC9X","order":"xqzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Draiver Unification: Eliminates dual orchestration (replaces pnpm -r in root with Nx run-many) and removes self-building anti-patterns ('pnpm run build &&') from sub-package test scripts to preserve computation caching.","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T05:56:50.706Z"}
