{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T07:07:44.969Z","id":"01M1DWQ6E94YEXFE4H5N68N3ZK","order":"vhzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Quantization Schemes: Mechanics of block quantization (Q4_0, Q8_0) and mixed-precision K-quants (Q4_K_M) vs. GPU-accelerated AWQ/GPTQ/EXL2, with RMSE, SNR (dB), and perplexity error metrics.","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T07:07:44.969Z"}
