{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T12:52:58.649Z","id":"01M1EGFAMSTZ2H9B98M182BMWH","order":"oqzzzzzzzz","props":{},"text":"Format Taxonomy: Single-file unified GGUF (llama.cpp/Ollama) vs. zero-copy SafeTensors (vLLM/Transformers) vs. Apple MLX unified SafeTensors (Metal native/LoRA) vs. Native FP8 E4M3/E5M2 (DeepSeek-V3/Hopper) vs. BitNet 1.58b ternary vs. dangerous PyTorch pickle (.pt/.bin RCE hazard) vs. compiled engines (ONNX/TensorRT).","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T12:52:58.649Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T03:24:17.980Z","id":"01M1G2ARNWVFX0JP03CNKWVYW0","order":"zxzzzzzzzp","props":{},"text":"nand2tetris: Ground-up CS track — build a computer from a Nand gate, then the full software stack (assembler, VM, Jack compiler, OS) using the official Nand2Tetris toolchain. Location: nand2tetris/ (HDL, Hack assembly, Jack). One folder per project 00-setup through 12-operating-system, each README links theory + live resources. Resources: nand2tetris.org, Coursera parts 1-2, official Q&A forum.","updatedAt":"2026-09-02T03:24:17.980Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T03:24:18.155Z","id":"01M1G2ARVBPJ4PKE2MSJ0Y721Z","order":"zyzzzzzzzu","props":{},"text":"automata-theory: Theory of computation primer (DFAs/NFAs, regex, CFGs, pumping lemma, Turing machines, decidability, P/NP). Location: automata-theory/ (notes hub). Pairs with nand2tetris: CFGs drive the Jack parser (project 10), universal-machine idea underlies the VM. Resources: MIT OCW 18.404J (Sipser lectures), Sipser 3rd ed, Neso Academy playlist.","updatedAt":"2026-09-02T03:24:18.155Z"}
{"children":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T03:24:18.296Z","id":"01M1G2ARZR31F12RNFK5ZNEBSG","props":{},"text":"category-theory: Category theory & type theory primer for programmers (categories, functors, natural transformations, products/coproducts, monads, Curry-Howard, parametricity). Location: category-theory/ (notes hub). Bridges to ts-type-level-safety and ts-features experiments. Resources: Milewski Category Theory for Programmers (free PDF + lectures), Awodey, Pierce TAPL.","updatedAt":"2026-09-02T03:24:18.296Z"}
